        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Uncontrolled type 1 diabetes among Egyptian adolescents; risk determinants and clinical outcomes</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #f4f7fb;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .poster {\n    max-width: 1650px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f4f7fb;\n    padding: 20px 40px 30px 40px;\n  }\n  /* Header banner */\n  .header-banner {\n    background: #0e2f6e;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 30px 40px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .header-text {\n    max-width: 78%;\n  }\n  .header-text h1 {\n    color: #7ec8f2;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 15px 0;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .header-text .authors {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .header-text .affiliation {\n    color: #b9cbe8;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .header-img-placeholder {\n    width: 220px;\n    height: 130px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #b9cbe8;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    border: 1px dashed transparent;\n  }\n  .divider-bar {\n    height: 6px;\n    background: linear-gradient(to right, #2f7fd6, #6db3ec);\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    margin: 18px 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  /* Main layout: 3 columns */\n  .content {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1.35fr 0.85fr;\n    gap: 35px;\n    align-items: start;\n  }\n  h2.section-title {\n    color: #123b7a;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .underline {\n    height: 3px;\n    width: 100%;\n    background: #4a9be0;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  section {\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n  p {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n  }\n  /* Methodology numbered steps */\n  .step {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .step-num {\n    background: #7ec8f2;\n    color: #0e2f6e;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 20px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .step p { margin: 0; }\n\n  /* Results table */\n  table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  table thead th {\n    background: #0e2f6e;\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 10px 6px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  table tbody td {\n    padding: 9px 6px;\n    text-align: center;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n  }\n  table tbody tr:nth-child(odd) {\n    background: #eef3fa;\n  }\n\n  .img-placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 260px;\n    border: 1px dashed #99a;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #556;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    background: #e6ecf5;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .img-row {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 20px;\n  }\n  .img-row .img-placeholder {\n    height: 320px;\n  }\n\n  /* Right column charts */\n  .chart-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #123b7a;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .chart-box {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\n  }\n  .donut-placeholder {\n    width: 170px;\n    height: 170px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 1px dashed #99a;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    color: #556;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #f4f7fb 45%, #cfe0f5 46% 100%);\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .legend {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n  .legend div {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 2px 4px;\n  }\n  .legend-color {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 10px;\n    height: 10px;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n  .legend-label {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .conclusion-section {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .footer-bar {\n    height: 5px;\n    background: linear-gradient(to right, #2f7fd6, #6db3ec);\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    margin: 25px 0 15px 0;\n  }\n  .footer-citation {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #333;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    padding: 0 60px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"poster\">\n\n  <!-- Header -->\n  <div class=\"header-banner\">\n    <div class=\"header-text\">\n      <h1>Uncontrolled type 1 diabetes among Egyptian adolescents; risk determinants and clinical outcomes</h1>\n      <p class=\"authors\">Safinaz Adel Elhabashy<sup>a</sup>, Eman M Mounir Sherif<sup>a</sup>, Nouran Yousef Salah<sup>a</sup>,<br>\n      Mostafa Ahmed Elsayed Abd Elkader<sup>b</sup>, Dina Ahmed Hosney Youssef<sup>a</sup></p>\n      <p class=\"affiliation\">Pediatrics Department, Faculty of Medicine, Ain Shams University, Cairo, Egypt</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"header-img-placeholder\">[Photo: hands holding stethoscope, top-right]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"divider-bar\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Main 3-column content -->\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <!-- Column 1 -->\n    <div class=\"col1\">\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Introduction</h2>\n        <div class=\"underline\"></div>\n        <p>Adolescents are exposed to multiple developmental, cognitive and emotional challenges, including independence and autonomy acquisition, identity and self esteem development, and social bond creation.</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Aim</h2>\n        <div class=\"underline\"></div>\n        <p>To assess the risk determinants and clinical outcomes of uncontrolled diabetes among Egyptian adolescents with T1D.</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Methodology</h2>\n        <div class=\"underline\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"step-num\">1</div>\n          <p>Six hundred adolescents with T1D were recruited from the Pediatric and Adolescents Diabetology Clinic, Ain-Shams University.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"step-num\">2</div>\n          <p>From the studied cohort, 200 with good glycemic control (&le;7%) and 200 with poor control (&gt;7%) were assessed for diabetes-duration, insulin regimen, frequency of diabetic-ketoacidosis, clinically significant hypoglycemia and the Mini-International Neuropsychiatric-Interview for Children and Adolescents.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"step-num\">3</div>\n          <p>Auxological assessment, fundus and clinical screening for complications were done.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"step-num\">4</div>\n          <p>Neuropathy was confirmed by nerve conduction velocity.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"step-num\">5</div>\n          <p>Thyroid profile, anti-tissue transglutaminase-IgG, fasting lipids and urinary albumin/excretion ratio (UAE) were measured.</p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Column 2 -->\n    <div class=\"col2\">\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Results</h2>\n        <div class=\"underline\"></div>\n        <p>Adolescents having uncontrolled diabetes have significantly higher diabetes onset age (p = 0.037), diabetes-duration (p = 0.038), eating disorders (p = 0.027), sadness (p = 0.038), depression (p = 0.003), suicidal manifestations (p = 0.001) and anxiety (p&lt;0.001) than the well-controlled group.</p>\n\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th>Variables</th>\n              <th>Adolescents with T1D (<i>n</i> = 400)</th>\n              <th>Well controlled Adolescents with T1D (<i>n</i> = 200)</th>\n              <th>Well controlled Adolescents with T1D (<i>n</i> = 200)</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Empty Cell</td>\n              <td>r</td>\n              <td>p-value</td>\n              <td>r</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Age (years)</td>\n              <td>&minus;0.054</td>\n              <td>0.282</td>\n              <td>0.000</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Age at diabetes onset (y)</td>\n              <td>0.122*</td>\n              <td>0.014</td>\n              <td>&minus;0.011</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Diabetes duration (y)</td>\n              <td>0.103*</td>\n              <td>0.039</td>\n              <td>0.098</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Insulin dosage (U/kg/day)</td>\n              <td>&minus;0.051</td>\n              <td>0.312</td>\n              <td>0.082</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Parent social standard</td>\n              <td>&minus;0.021</td>\n              <td>0.671</td>\n              <td>&minus;0.121</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Weight z-score</td>\n              <td>&minus;0.043</td>\n              <td>0.391</td>\n              <td>&minus;0.025</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Height z-score</td>\n              <td>&minus;0.081</td>\n              <td>0.106</td>\n              <td>0.065</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>BMI z-score</td>\n              <td>0.040</td>\n              <td>0.425</td>\n              <td>&minus;0.067</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n\n        <div class=\"img-placeholder\">[Photo: doctor holding stethoscope, bottom-center]</div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Column 3 -->\n    <div class=\"col3\">\n      <div class=\"chart-box\">\n        <div class=\"chart-title\">Generalized anxiety</div>\n        <div class=\"donut-placeholder\">[Donut chart:<br>Generalized anxiety]</div>\n        <div class=\"legend\">\n          <div><span class=\"legend-label\"><span class=\"legend-color\" style=\"background:#2f7fd6;\"></span>Adolescents with T1D</span><span>20%</span></div>\n          <div><span class=\"legend-label\"><span class=\"legend-color\" style=\"background:#7ec8f2;\"></span>Well controlled Adolescents</span><span>20%</span></div>\n          <div><span class=\"legend-label\"><span class=\"legend-color\" style=\"background:#cfe0f5;\"></span>Poorly controlled Adolescents</span><span>60%</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"chart-box\">\n        <div class=\"chart-title\">Frequency of DKA /yeared anxiety</div>\n        <div class=\"donut-placeholder\">[Donut chart:<br>Frequency of DKA]</div>\n        <div class=\"legend\">\n          <div><span class=\"legend-label\"><span class=\"legend-color\" style=\"background:#2f7fd6;\"></span>Adolescents with T1D</span><span>20%</span></div>\n          <div><span class=\"legend-label\"><span class=\"legend-color\" style=\"background:#7ec8f2;\"></span>Well controlled Adolescents</span><span>20%</span></div>\n          <div><span class=\"legend-label\"><span class=\"legend-color\" style=\"background:#cfe0f5;\"></span>Poorly controlled Adolescents</span><span>60%</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <section class=\"conclusion-section\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Conclusion</h2>\n        <div class=\"underline\"></div>\n        <p>Uncontrolled T1D among adolescents is associated with older age and psychiatric comorbidities. Furthermore, it is linked to school absenteeism, hyperlipidemia, diabetic nephropathy and neuropathy.</p>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Bottom images row spanning column 2 and 3 area visually, placed as in original -->\n  <div class=\"footer-bar\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer-citation\">\n    Elhabashy, S.A., Sherif, E.M.M., Salah, N.Y., Abd Elkader, M.A.E. and Youssef, D.A.H., 2022. Uncontrolled type 1 diabetes among Egyptian adolescents; risk determinants dina and clinical outcomes. Diabetes Epidemiology and Management, 6, p.100051.\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
